claim.claim-text:
an atrial portion (22) for placement in the left atrium (2);
a ventricular portion (24) for placement in the left ventricle (4); and
one or more retention members (26) that couple the atrial portion (22) to the ventricular portion (24);
wherein one of the atrial portion (22) and the ventricular portion (24) includes a prosthetic valve structure (25);

wherein the ventricular portion (24) is configured to extend at least partially behind the native mitral leaflets;
wherein the atrial portion (22) and the ventricular portion (24) are configured to become engaged on opposite sides of the native mitral valve to anchor the prosthetic mitral valve (20);
wherein a length of the one or more retention members (26) between the atrial portion (22) and the ventricular portion (24) is configured to shorten, thereby reducing a distance between the atrial portion (22) and the ventricular portion (24);
wherein the ventricular portion (24) comprises a plurality of hooks (28);
wherein the ventricular portion (24) can be moved upward toward the atrial portion (22) by shortening the length of the retention members (26) therebetween, such that the ventricular portion (24) moves into the native valve orifice between the native leaflets (8) and the hooks (28) reach around the leaflets (8) and pull the leaflets (8) upward toward the annulus and the atrial portion.
